# FIX-116 ratchet for scripts/guards/limits-readers.sh: known gaps, one `NAME tag` per line.
# unread = no reader outside limits.rs (wire it or delete it with its docs/02 row);
# no-row = no docs/02 row; doc-only = docs/02 names it but limits.rs does not define it.
# Entries can only be removed: closing a gap without removing its line fails the guard.
# Exception (coordinator): a spec step may add `doc-only` entries for limits it specifies before
# the code exists, marked with the task that must close them; that task's lane removes them.
# FIX-146 (spec step 0, 2026-11-14) — Part A2 adds DB_SPAN_STATEMENT_MAX, Part D the TELEMETRY_*:
